WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.185 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:34.905 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:47.225 --> 01:48.545
The sun's gone!

5
01:50.105 --> 01:51.465
Lu Zhuo!

6
01:51.545 --> 01:53.585
-Run! -Everyone run!

7
01:53.665 --> 01:54.545
Lu Zhuo!

8
01:54.625 --> 01:56.305
-Get out! -Run!

9
01:56.385 --> 01:57.345
Run!

10
01:57.425 --> 01:58.705
Leave now!

11
01:58.785 --> 01:59.625
Wei Rao!

12
02:00.185 --> 02:01.545
Hurry!

13
02:01.625 --> 02:04.945
-The sun's been swallowed! -Run!

14
02:05.025 --> 02:06.465
What should we do?

15
02:06.545 --> 02:07.785
Move!

16
02:30.705 --> 02:31.545
Wei Rao!

17
03:24.265 --> 03:26.065
You knew everything outside was in chaos.

18
03:26.785 --> 03:29.825
You're always so careful, so determined to protect yourself.

19
03:30.425 --> 03:32.305
Why did you throw yourself into the crowd?

20
03:33.865 --> 03:35.945
If the sun never rose again,

21
03:38.385 --> 03:40.905
I didn't want to die alone.

22
03:42.425 --> 03:44.465
I won't let you be alone.

23
03:53.905 --> 03:54.745
Wei Rao.

24
03:58.345 --> 03:59.625
How long do I have to wait?

25
04:01.425 --> 04:05.545
Right here, right now, I can give you my answer.

26
04:42.185 --> 04:44.985
This is grander than a royal princess's wedding!

27
04:45.065 --> 04:47.625
Her Ladyship is a blessing to everyone she helps.

28
04:47.705 --> 04:49.625
She's truly blessed.

29
04:49.705 --> 04:51.305
To marry a woman like her,

30
04:51.385 --> 04:53.065
Lord Lu must be the luckiest man alive!

31
04:55.905 --> 04:58.185
A hero and a beauty, a match made in heaven!

32
04:58.265 --> 04:59.625
Congratulations!

33
05:00.505 --> 05:02.905
May Her Ladyship and Lord Lu stay together forever

34
05:02.985 --> 05:03.985
and love each other for life!

35
06:02.905 --> 06:04.345
Lord Lu is back.

36
06:13.665 --> 06:15.665
BLISS

37
06:30.265 --> 06:32.145
You're certainly making yourself at home.

38
06:33.825 --> 06:34.665
What are you reading?

39
06:38.825 --> 06:40.745
FARMING METHODS

40
06:40.825 --> 06:43.225
You're quite devoted to farming, Your Ladyship.

41
06:43.945 --> 06:45.105
Even on our wedding night,

42
06:46.785 --> 06:47.625
you can't put it off.

43
06:48.425 --> 06:51.385
You took so long, so I picked up something to read.

44
07:03.225 --> 07:04.385
What are you looking at?

45
07:05.425 --> 07:06.665
Just looking, like you.

46
07:12.185 --> 07:14.425
You're… You're blocking my light.

47
07:15.425 --> 07:16.385
My mistake.

48
07:41.945 --> 07:43.185
What are you reading, My Lord?

49
07:44.225 --> 07:45.225
Curious, Your Ladyship?

50
07:54.225 --> 07:55.185
It's brighter over here.

51
08:12.665 --> 08:14.945
When did you steal that? Give it back!

52
08:22.305 --> 08:23.465
That bridal booklet…

53
08:25.265 --> 08:26.905
Weren't you the one who peeked at it first?

54
08:26.985 --> 08:28.065
Don't you dare bring it up.

55
08:28.985 --> 08:29.905
Your Ladyship.

56
08:31.425 --> 08:32.985
Don't you think I'm better than a book?

57
09:47.185 --> 09:51.225
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

58
09:51.305 --> 09:56.385
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

59
10:00.065 --> 10:01.665
I'll take care of it.

60
10:01.745 --> 10:03.145
But, My Lord…

61
10:07.225 --> 10:08.705
BLISS

62
10:48.625 --> 10:49.785
Time to get up.

63
11:16.025 --> 11:18.665
It's okay. I'm right here.

64
11:19.665 --> 11:21.145
What time is it?

65
11:22.025 --> 11:24.065
Shouldn't we be paying our respects to the elders?

66
11:26.145 --> 11:27.625
I had someone apologize for us already

67
11:31.145 --> 11:32.825
The sun's already high in the sky!

68
11:32.905 --> 11:34.505
You're trying to have me laughed at.

69
11:34.585 --> 11:36.025
I did try to wake you.

70
11:36.865 --> 11:37.705
You wouldn't wake up.

71
11:38.545 --> 11:40.105
And whose fault is that?

72
11:41.905 --> 11:43.905
Go get Aman to help me get dressed.

73
11:44.785 --> 11:45.665
All right.

74
11:53.025 --> 11:54.345
The maids are too slow.

75
11:54.425 --> 11:55.945
Let me attend to you, Your Ladyship.

76
11:56.505 --> 11:58.825
Are you crazy? Put me down!

77
12:08.505 --> 12:13.185
She's the one threatened by the Han family to falsely accuse our family.

78
12:13.785 --> 12:15.705
I hear Her Ladyship took her as a sworn sister.

79
12:16.305 --> 12:19.185
And from now on, she'll be living at the Duke's residence.

80
12:20.225 --> 12:22.385
Wei Rao had the nerve to marry into this family again.

81
12:22.465 --> 12:23.945
Grandfather already disapproves of her.

82
12:24.705 --> 12:27.665
Now she's bringing in some ill-mannered country girl with no morals.

83
12:27.745 --> 12:29.065
She's gone too far!

84
12:30.625 --> 12:32.145
Why are you bringing this up?

85
12:32.705 --> 12:34.785
Changning, don't go!

86
12:34.865 --> 12:36.665
Lady Wu'an may throw her weight around outside,

87
12:36.745 --> 12:38.625
but once she enters the Duke's residence,

88
12:38.705 --> 12:40.585
she must obey the family's rules and elders.

89
12:41.225 --> 12:43.625
Once Grandfather hears, she'll be in trouble.

90
12:45.505 --> 12:46.345
Stop right there!

91
12:47.025 --> 12:49.985
You're the fraud who set up our family at the ancestral temple.

92
12:50.065 --> 12:51.425
How dare you come here?

93
12:53.625 --> 12:54.625
Who are you people?

94
12:55.705 --> 12:56.545
Xiao!

95
12:59.385 --> 13:00.225
You're scaring her.

96
13:01.785 --> 13:03.505
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

97
13:04.265 --> 13:06.465
Xiao is my bodyguard. He didn't scare you, did he?

98
13:07.145 --> 13:09.505
He's so crude and ill-mannered, hardly like a bodyguard.

99
13:11.625 --> 13:13.065
When the Hutuo raided

100
13:13.145 --> 13:15.025
they seized Xiao's cattle and sheep.

101
13:15.545 --> 13:17.305
He chased them for miles and recovered

102
13:17.385 --> 13:18.945
half the herd with bare hands.

103
13:19.025 --> 13:23.105
Later, the governor robbed the people and tried to flee the city.

104
13:23.185 --> 13:24.865
He even offered the Hutuo gold and silver.

105
13:26.745 --> 13:28.945
Xiao, what did you do?

106
13:29.025 --> 13:30.025
Chopped him into mincemeat.

107
13:31.385 --> 13:33.345
How can you keep someone like that around?

108
13:34.305 --> 13:37.345
My personal guards are all refugees I've taken in.

109
13:38.025 --> 13:40.105
They're not bloodthirsty killers.

110
13:40.185 --> 13:42.825
This cruel world left them no other choice.

111
13:43.465 --> 13:44.745
Don't worry.

112
13:44.825 --> 13:46.385
Xiao only cuts people up. He doesn't eat them.

113
13:57.225 --> 13:58.065
Starting today,

114
13:58.985 --> 14:01.145
Hongxian will study etiquette with you.

115
14:01.825 --> 14:03.985
Changning, Changhui, take good care of your new sister.

116
14:06.465 --> 14:07.825
Hongxian has only just arrived.

117
14:07.905 --> 14:09.705
She may not know the capital's latest styles.

118
14:09.785 --> 14:12.265
I think we're about the same size.

119
14:12.345 --> 14:14.465
I have a few newly tailored dresses.

120
14:14.545 --> 14:16.385
They're all the latest styles.

121
14:16.465 --> 14:18.025
Xiao, you go and help Hongxian answer questions.

122
14:19.705 --> 14:21.465
Aman, go with them.

123
14:27.585 --> 14:28.985
Have you decided on courtyards yet?

124
14:29.065 --> 14:31.305
Need anything? I'll get it for you.

125
14:32.025 --> 14:34.905
My Lord won't blame me for scaring your sister, will you?

126
14:36.545 --> 14:37.385
Come on.

127
14:38.505 --> 14:39.345
I have something to show you.

128
14:53.985 --> 14:57.105
I had the servants pull up all the flowers in this garden

129
14:57.185 --> 14:58.145
and plant alfalfa instead.

130
14:59.145 --> 15:01.185
It survives cold and drought and grows easily.

131
15:01.265 --> 15:03.385
It makes horses strong and well-fed.

132
15:04.665 --> 15:07.065
Especially this purple alfalfa.

133
15:07.945 --> 15:09.425
Will it grow in barren hills and valleys?

134
15:10.305 --> 15:11.145
Why wouldn't it?

135
15:12.665 --> 15:13.665
Wei Rao.

136
15:13.745 --> 15:17.385
This humble weed can turn wasteland into grazing land.

137
15:17.985 --> 15:20.545
The army needs plenty of fodder, too.

138
15:21.385 --> 15:25.585
You went to all that trouble finding these seeds just to please me?

139
15:26.185 --> 15:29.025
Sounds like this gift is just what you wanted.

140
15:38.705 --> 15:40.025
Your Ladyship.

141
15:41.585 --> 15:42.865
How will you thank me?

142
15:46.465 --> 15:50.625
I happen to have a fine sword that cuts through iron like butter.

143
15:51.745 --> 15:53.065
How about I give you that?

144
16:02.945 --> 16:04.545
I've never been on a swing before.

145
16:05.065 --> 16:06.145
Give me a push.

146
16:20.545 --> 16:21.585
Where did you get that sword?

147
16:21.665 --> 16:22.745
General Qi gave it to me.

148
16:22.825 --> 16:25.305
He also gave me a bow he made himself.

149
16:26.105 --> 16:27.025
Push me higher.

150
16:44.225 --> 16:47.185
Why did you push so hard?

151
16:47.265 --> 16:48.105
Wei Rao.

152
16:49.905 --> 16:51.665
You didn't know what's love.

153
16:51.745 --> 16:55.145
Your heart is full of cold suspicion and distrust.

154
16:56.465 --> 16:59.585
You keep testing me and hurting me.

155
17:00.505 --> 17:02.185
You tear my heart to pieces

156
17:03.145 --> 17:04.464
just to feel safe.

157
17:05.745 --> 17:07.545
But if you keep provoking me,

158
17:08.785 --> 17:11.785
there's no telling what I'll do next time.

159
17:13.545 --> 17:16.665
You knew what I was like, yet you married me anyway.

160
17:17.665 --> 17:19.224
If you ever learn what love is,

161
17:22.785 --> 17:23.985
you'll have me by your side, and me only.

162
17:24.985 --> 17:26.825
What if I never learn, not in this lifetime?

163
17:26.905 --> 17:28.065
Then in this lifetime,

164
17:28.865 --> 17:30.505
you'll still be mine.

165
17:39.905 --> 17:42.865
I don't know what my brother sees in her.

166
17:42.945 --> 17:46.465
He passed up the virtuous Lady Xie to marry that temptress instead.

167
17:47.065 --> 17:48.505
Just look at the people she brought home.

168
17:49.105 --> 17:51.225
No. I'm telling Mother.

169
17:51.305 --> 17:52.585
We can't have fugitives living here.

170
17:53.185 --> 17:55.145
She has a noble title and a fine reputation.

171
17:55.225 --> 17:56.985
Even Grandmother favors her.

172
17:57.065 --> 17:59.545
If you complain, you'll only get yourself in trouble.

173
18:00.145 --> 18:02.265
So we just let her do whatever she wants?

174
18:03.265 --> 18:04.505
What's got you so worked up?

175
18:05.025 --> 18:06.705
My lady, we've had little rain this spring.

176
18:06.785 --> 18:08.425
Second Madam ordered the backyard wells cleaned.

177
18:09.025 --> 18:11.545
And in one of the wells, we… we found a body!

178
18:12.145 --> 18:13.905
We were just about to report it to Second Madam.

179
18:14.545 --> 18:15.385
Which well?

180
18:15.465 --> 18:17.025
The one behind Songyue Hall.

181
18:17.105 --> 18:18.505
The abandoned well in the woods.

182
18:22.825 --> 18:25.065
Come on. Let's take a look.

183
18:27.745 --> 18:28.585
Your Ladyship.

184
18:28.665 --> 18:30.585
They found something in the woods behind Songyue Hall.

185
18:30.665 --> 18:32.025
A body.

186
18:41.745 --> 18:44.145
Your Grace. Grandmother.

187
18:45.265 --> 18:47.745
Governess Miao, tell her.

188
18:48.865 --> 18:49.745
Your Ladyship.

189
18:49.825 --> 18:52.665
The body pulled from the garden well today

190
18:52.745 --> 18:55.585
has been identified as one of your attendants.

191
18:55.665 --> 18:56.505
Governess Wu.

192
18:57.465 --> 18:58.425
Governess Wu?

193
18:59.865 --> 19:01.105
Your Ladyship,

194
19:01.185 --> 19:03.945
you've only just married into the family.

195
19:04.025 --> 19:05.385
We shouldn't have to trouble you with this.

196
19:05.985 --> 19:08.345
But the imperial court issued a decree long ago.

197
19:08.425 --> 19:11.825
Anyone who abuses a servant to death must be severely punished with a beating.

198
19:12.585 --> 19:15.745
And Governess Wu came with you from the Wei family.

199
19:15.825 --> 19:17.825
Given her age and position,

200
19:17.905 --> 19:20.465
she deserved even greater respect.

201
19:20.545 --> 19:23.265
How could you have her killed on a whim?

202
19:23.905 --> 19:25.065
Of course, in noble households,

203
19:25.865 --> 19:28.825
a servant or two dying isn't unusual.

204
19:28.905 --> 19:31.025
The authorities don't act unless someone reports it.

205
19:31.105 --> 19:33.145
-That's right. -But a family like ours,

206
19:33.945 --> 19:35.585
known for honor and integrity,

207
19:35.665 --> 19:39.745
cannot afford a reputation for abusing servants to death!

208
19:39.825 --> 19:42.225
-What a disgrace that would be! -Enough.

209
19:42.905 --> 19:45.705
The Lu ancestors defended the nation and its people.

210
19:45.785 --> 19:47.185
Brave generals died in battles.

211
19:47.825 --> 19:50.625
Their loyalty and courage are still praised today.

212
19:50.705 --> 19:53.625
If our family welcomed a cruel, murderous daughter-in-law,

213
19:53.705 --> 19:56.905
what would the world think of the Lu family?

214
19:58.185 --> 20:00.225
We don't even know how she died.

215
20:00.305 --> 20:03.825
Perhaps she slipped and fell into the well at night.

216
20:05.025 --> 20:05.945
Aunt.

217
20:06.545 --> 20:07.985
Those woods are deserted.

218
20:08.065 --> 20:09.865
No one ever goes there.

219
20:10.825 --> 20:12.505
If Her Ladyship did kill her by accident,

220
20:13.225 --> 20:16.305
she should admit it now so we can decide what to do.

221
20:16.905 --> 20:18.785
If a censor brings charges later,

222
20:18.865 --> 20:20.905
we'll be ready to handle it

223
20:20.985 --> 20:23.305
without dragging my cousin into this.

224
20:23.385 --> 20:24.665
Enough.

225
20:25.185 --> 20:27.905
-What proof do you have? -Bring it in.

226
20:38.425 --> 20:39.625
See?

227
20:39.705 --> 20:40.545
What's the meaning of this?

228
20:41.545 --> 20:43.225
The silver needle was inserted into her throat.

229
20:43.305 --> 20:45.185
It came out completely black.

230
20:45.265 --> 20:48.105
Governess Wu was clearly poisoned!

231
20:52.545 --> 20:55.785
If you had nothing to do with her death,

232
20:55.865 --> 20:59.545
why were you so certain she'd returned to the Wei residence?

233
21:04.585 --> 21:07.905
Rao, dear, what on earth happened?

234
21:09.905 --> 21:11.505
I'll smash your head in!

235
21:16.145 --> 21:18.065
I do owe this family an explanation.

236
21:19.745 --> 21:21.065
-That's… -You're asking the wrong person!

237
21:26.225 --> 21:27.305
You should be asking me.

238
21:33.425 --> 21:34.505
Grandfather, Grandmother.

239
21:35.185 --> 21:36.305
There's no need to pressure Wei Rao.

240
21:37.825 --> 21:38.745
She's taking the blame for me.

241
21:43.785 --> 21:44.905
Taking the blame for you?

242
21:47.545 --> 21:50.625
That old woman snuck into my study and tried to read my military reports.

243
21:51.385 --> 21:53.825
Zhao Song caught her in the act. She took poison and killed herself.

244
21:54.585 --> 21:56.145
I meant to have her body removed,

245
21:56.225 --> 21:57.865
but I didn't want to alert her accomplices.

246
21:58.385 --> 21:59.785
I feared the news would upset Her Ladyship.

247
21:59.865 --> 22:01.185
So I had the body disposed quietly.

248
22:02.505 --> 22:04.785
After that, I suspected there were more spies in the residence.

249
22:04.865 --> 22:08.145
-So I set a trap to catch them. -My dear.

250
22:12.305 --> 22:13.345
I know you can't bear to do it.

251
22:13.425 --> 22:15.305
But national security was at stake.

252
22:15.385 --> 22:18.465
Leaving her body intact was already more mercy than she deserved.

253
22:19.105 --> 22:20.105
Zhuo.

254
22:20.185 --> 22:21.585
Even if that old woman was a spy,

255
22:22.185 --> 22:23.865
she served Her Ladyship.

256
22:23.945 --> 22:26.305
How can you say she had nothing to do with it?

257
22:30.065 --> 22:31.385
What else are you suggesting?

258
22:32.345 --> 22:34.505
-That Wei Rao is a spy, too? -I…

259
22:34.585 --> 22:35.545
If she were a spy,

260
22:35.625 --> 22:38.065
Han Liao would've framed the Lu family successfully.

261
22:38.145 --> 22:39.865
You wouldn't be standing here spouting nonsense!

262
22:41.705 --> 22:43.305
I spoke out of turn.

263
22:43.905 --> 22:47.105
But I was only looking out for you and the Lu family.

264
22:48.265 --> 22:49.545
What's so surprising about that?

265
22:50.145 --> 22:53.185
Even in Lu Zhuo's Songyue Hall, that servant Anfu

266
22:53.265 --> 22:54.545
was bribed into a traitor, right?

267
22:55.145 --> 22:58.545
Traitors are everywhere. You can never be too careful.

268
22:59.745 --> 23:01.505
Rao, none of this is your fault.

269
23:01.585 --> 23:03.425
I'm sorry you had such a fright.

270
23:05.225 --> 23:06.225
Thank you, Grandmother.

271
23:07.065 --> 23:10.065
When I learned my servant had done wrong, I was terrified.

272
23:10.665 --> 23:12.665
I should've told the elders sooner.

273
23:12.745 --> 23:14.105
The misunderstanding today could be avoided.

274
23:16.145 --> 23:18.865
She was a spy. Killing her was justified.

275
23:18.945 --> 23:21.465
You couldn't even get the facts straight.

276
23:21.545 --> 23:22.905
Is this how you run the household?

277
23:22.985 --> 23:24.665
You've made fools of us all.

278
23:24.745 --> 23:27.145
I… I failed to look into it properly.

279
23:27.225 --> 23:29.385
I nearly accused an innocent woman.

280
23:29.465 --> 23:30.505
Please forgive me.

281
23:33.665 --> 23:34.905
I'm at fault, too.

282
23:34.985 --> 23:36.585
I should've asked Lu Zhuo first.

283
23:36.665 --> 23:37.745
Yes.

284
23:37.825 --> 23:41.465
An upright heart leads to upright conduct.

285
23:41.545 --> 23:42.585
Enough.

286
23:43.105 --> 23:44.585
The matter is settled.

287
23:44.665 --> 23:45.705
You may all leave.

288
23:50.905 --> 23:51.985
What are you around for?

289
23:52.065 --> 23:53.705
Waiting for a reward?

290
23:59.225 --> 24:00.145
Rao.

291
24:01.025 --> 24:03.305
Come rest with me.

292
24:04.625 --> 24:05.625
Pay them no mind.

293
24:05.705 --> 24:09.025
Don't let such petty troubles weigh on your heart.

294
24:19.305 --> 24:21.385
What's gotten into you, child? What were you thinking?

295
24:21.465 --> 24:24.105
Back in the hall, you didn't stand up for your cousin-in-law.

296
24:24.185 --> 24:26.185
Instead, you stirred up trouble for an outsider!

297
24:26.265 --> 24:29.425
Aunt. It was only a servant who died.

298
24:29.505 --> 24:32.185
Do you really think the court would punish Her Ladyship for that?

299
24:33.305 --> 24:36.705
They made a fuss just to put Her Ladyship in her place

300
24:37.305 --> 24:39.305
so she wouldn't be so overbearing.

301
24:40.345 --> 24:43.585
Aunt. I was looking out for you, too.

302
24:43.665 --> 24:44.905
A daughter-in-law outranking her mother-in-law,

303
24:44.985 --> 24:46.025
and doing whatever she pleases,

304
24:46.105 --> 24:47.625
is bound to cause trouble someday.

305
24:49.385 --> 24:50.505
If Mother keeps listening to her schemes,

306
24:51.105 --> 24:52.905
there'll be no end to the trouble.

307
24:52.985 --> 24:55.025
-Zhuo, you've misunderstood. -Mother.

308
24:55.745 --> 24:57.425
Weiyu belongs to the He family.

309
24:57.505 --> 24:58.985
It's time she went back to her family.

310
24:59.585 --> 25:01.505
Let Uncle arrange a marriage for her.

311
25:01.585 --> 25:04.945
Zhuo, what… what did I do wrong?

312
25:05.025 --> 25:05.945
Are you sending me away?

313
25:06.545 --> 25:08.025
Aunt, you…

314
25:08.825 --> 25:12.665
Zhuo, dear. Your cousin Weiyu grew up by my side.

315
25:12.745 --> 25:15.625
She's no different from my own daughter now.

316
25:15.705 --> 25:18.105
She's young and doesn't know any better.

317
25:18.185 --> 25:21.945
She said some foolish things, but surely that's no reason to send her away.

318
25:22.025 --> 25:22.985
I'm trying to save her.

319
25:23.665 --> 25:26.505
Wei Rao's maids are mostly palace old-timers.

320
25:27.025 --> 25:27.985
Lady Li sent them

321
25:28.585 --> 25:30.545
to make sure her daughter was treated well.

322
25:31.185 --> 25:32.705
You stirred up trouble against her.

323
25:32.785 --> 25:35.185
and accused Her Ladyship of killing a servant.

324
25:35.785 --> 25:37.305
If word reaches the palace tomorrow,

325
25:38.265 --> 25:40.065
what do you think will happen to you?

326
25:40.145 --> 25:42.425
Zhuo, I didn't!

327
25:43.025 --> 25:44.065
Please save me!

328
25:44.785 --> 25:45.825
Weiyu!

329
25:45.905 --> 25:49.425
Rao's mother adores her daughter.

330
25:49.505 --> 25:50.585
How could you be so foolish?

331
25:51.385 --> 25:54.265
Zhuo, I understand what you're saying.

332
25:54.345 --> 25:57.585
I'll write to my brother at once and have him take her home.

333
25:57.665 --> 25:59.345
Until the He family comes for her,

334
25:59.425 --> 26:00.865
I'll keep her to her room.

335
26:00.945 --> 26:02.505
She won't be allowed to wander around.

336
26:03.225 --> 26:09.985
Could you do me a favor and apologize to Rao on Weiyu's behalf?

337
26:10.065 --> 26:12.465
-Aunt! -Please, say no more.

338
26:13.065 --> 26:15.945
Weiyu may be foolish, but at least Mother knows better.

339
26:16.545 --> 26:18.225
-I know. I know. -Zhuo!

340
26:18.305 --> 26:19.425
I did it because I love you.

341
26:19.505 --> 26:21.385
That's why I said those things.

342
26:21.465 --> 26:23.225
But I haven't done anything serious.

343
26:23.305 --> 26:25.785
I know I was wrong! I really do!

344
26:25.865 --> 26:27.465
Zhuo! You…

345
26:27.545 --> 26:28.905
I'll leave her alone from now on.

346
26:29.665 --> 26:31.905
I worked so hard to keep her by my side.

347
26:32.425 --> 26:33.465
And you tried to drive her away

348
26:34.185 --> 26:35.825
and come between my wife and me.

349
26:35.905 --> 26:36.945
That is unforgivable.

350
26:38.145 --> 26:39.425
Send her back soon.

351
26:39.945 --> 26:40.945
I don't want to see her again.

352
26:41.585 --> 26:42.585
Zhuo!

353
26:43.145 --> 26:45.825
-Zhuo! My cousin! -That's enough! Stop.

354
26:45.905 --> 26:46.905
Be quiet!

355
27:07.065 --> 27:08.465
No matter who you're angry with,

356
27:08.545 --> 27:10.545
don't take it out on your health.

357
27:14.025 --> 27:15.865
Rice porridge is good for your stomach.

358
27:15.945 --> 27:16.985
At least have a little.

359
27:28.585 --> 27:29.545
Why?

360
27:33.785 --> 27:35.025
Who asked you to lie for me?

361
27:39.265 --> 27:40.225
Try it.

362
27:41.705 --> 27:42.665
Answer me.

363
27:43.905 --> 27:44.785
Answer what?

364
27:46.225 --> 27:47.265
That night,

365
27:48.185 --> 27:49.265
by the well,

366
27:49.945 --> 27:51.385
you clearly saw me there.

367
27:51.985 --> 27:53.185
I lied to you.

368
27:53.705 --> 27:56.145
Don't you want to know how Governess Wu died?

369
27:56.825 --> 27:59.865
Maybe I was afraid she'd expose my identity,

370
27:59.945 --> 28:01.625
so I killed her to keep her quiet.

371
28:01.705 --> 28:02.905
Lu Zhuo!

372
28:02.985 --> 28:05.785
You covered for me without even asking!

373
28:06.985 --> 28:07.905
Because I trust you.

374
28:10.225 --> 28:11.585
You'd never harm the innocent.

375
28:16.585 --> 28:20.625
You're a man of honor, with integrity beyond reproach.

376
28:21.145 --> 28:22.145
Please don't do it again.

377
28:23.185 --> 28:24.265
Don't do what?

378
28:26.105 --> 28:27.625
Don't keep giving in for my sake.

379
28:28.905 --> 28:30.785
Don't compromise your principles for me.

380
28:31.305 --> 28:32.585
And don't lie for me again.

381
28:41.905 --> 28:45.265
Everyone wants the person they love to be sincere and innocent,

382
28:45.785 --> 28:47.105
kind and selfless.

383
28:49.065 --> 28:49.905
But that's not who you are.

384
28:51.625 --> 28:53.025
And that's fine.

385
28:54.105 --> 28:58.305
Whether you had no other choice or you're coldhearted by nature,

386
29:02.985 --> 29:04.105
as long as it's you,

387
29:05.745 --> 29:06.865
I'll always help you.

388
29:16.745 --> 29:21.865
Marriages between noble families are built on mutual respect and courtesy.

389
29:22.585 --> 29:25.865
When hardship strikes, the families could support each other,

390
29:25.945 --> 29:27.385
and that's enough for a good marriage.

391
29:27.465 --> 29:28.625
You…

392
29:32.705 --> 29:33.905
You don't have to be so good to me.

393
29:35.025 --> 29:36.265
Wei Rao.

394
29:36.345 --> 29:38.345
Crossing boundaries means losing control!

395
29:38.425 --> 29:39.665
And I hate losing control!

396
29:49.305 --> 29:51.345
I'm sure the Duke has warned you repeatedly

397
29:52.145 --> 29:54.065
not to get carried away by romance.

398
29:54.145 --> 29:55.945
We must listen to our elders.

399
29:56.465 --> 29:58.825
I've sent your military books and bedding to the study.

400
29:59.545 --> 30:01.265
You're heartless.

401
30:01.345 --> 30:04.625
We're newlyweds, and you're already kicking me out?

402
30:04.705 --> 30:08.225
Your noble families believe too much indulgence shortens one's life.

403
30:09.385 --> 30:11.905
From now on, we should share a bed on the first and fifteenth of each month.

404
30:12.945 --> 30:14.785
I'm tired. You may go, My Lord.

405
30:15.825 --> 30:17.065
It's only been two days.

406
30:21.025 --> 30:22.625
Good night, My Lord.

407
30:33.865 --> 30:38.105
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

408
31:02.505 --> 31:03.865
You're certainly on your guard, Your Ladyship.

409
31:05.705 --> 31:06.905
Get off the bed.

410
31:06.985 --> 31:08.625
You know I can help you.

411
31:08.705 --> 31:10.305
You should be holding on to me.

412
31:10.385 --> 31:11.745
Why do you keep pushing me away?

413
31:12.905 --> 31:14.545
What are you so afraid of?

414
31:15.225 --> 31:16.585
That you'll depend on me too much?

415
31:17.105 --> 31:18.065
Or…

416
31:19.985 --> 31:21.345
Are you afraid falling in love with me?

417
31:27.745 --> 31:29.905
You think awfully highly of yourself, My Lord.

418
31:40.145 --> 31:41.425
Well, I'm not leaving.

419
31:47.305 --> 31:48.825
I told you not to marry me.

420
31:50.665 --> 31:54.105
Tell me, what kind of couple is as strange as we are?

421
31:54.785 --> 31:56.905
Then we'll be a strange couple.

422
31:57.825 --> 32:01.825
You can hate me or refuse to love me for the rest of your life.

423
32:01.905 --> 32:03.985
We can fight every single day.

424
32:05.385 --> 32:06.985
I'll still hold you in my arms.

425
32:08.945 --> 32:10.345
Let's get by together.

426
32:10.425 --> 32:11.985
A lifetime between you and me.

427
32:12.585 --> 32:14.825
-How is that not love? -You…

428
32:16.865 --> 32:18.025
I'm tired.

429
32:24.585 --> 32:26.305
You brought this on yourself.

430
32:27.025 --> 32:30.505
Once I claim something as mine, I'd rather die than let it go.

431
32:31.945 --> 32:33.945
So never ask me to let you go.

432
32:34.545 --> 32:36.385
Not in this life or any other.

433
32:56.865 --> 32:58.105
What's wrong?

434
32:59.825 --> 33:01.145
You're freezing cold, My Lord.

435
33:01.225 --> 33:02.625
I don't want to sleep next to you.

436
33:02.705 --> 33:04.065
Go sleep at the other end.

437
33:13.265 --> 33:16.145
I forgot you can't stand the cold. My mistake.

438
33:23.145 --> 33:25.465
Allow me to warm your bed, Your Ladyship.

439
33:25.545 --> 33:26.665
Lu Zhuo!

440
33:38.585 --> 33:41.145
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

441
33:56.105 --> 33:59.225
Your Ladyship lends grain to the villagers using a large measure,

442
33:59.305 --> 34:00.745
but asks to repay with a smaller one.

443
34:01.345 --> 34:02.705
To thank Your Ladyship,

444
34:02.785 --> 34:04.585
they pick the freshest wild greens in the hills

445
34:04.665 --> 34:06.385
and carry them all the way into town.

446
34:06.465 --> 34:08.665
You refuse them, so they leave the greens and run.

447
34:09.185 --> 34:12.105
They bring more every day. What should we do?

448
34:18.625 --> 34:20.185
Your Ladyship, the Fourth Prince is here.

449
34:20.264 --> 34:21.185
Rao!

450
34:21.945 --> 34:22.865
Rao!

451
34:24.304 --> 34:25.344
Put them down.

452
34:26.625 --> 34:27.665
Rao.

453
34:27.744 --> 34:29.665
These fresh oranges are tribute from the south.

454
34:29.744 --> 34:31.425
Mother told me to bring them all to you.

455
34:33.585 --> 34:34.985
That's a lot of wild greens.

456
34:35.065 --> 34:36.105
Can you eat them all, Rao?

457
34:36.784 --> 34:38.225
No, I can't. Take them with you.

458
34:40.105 --> 34:41.185
Your Highness.

459
34:41.264 --> 34:43.105
You are not here only for the oranges, right?

460
34:44.065 --> 34:45.824
Nothing gets past you, Zhuo.

461
34:46.665 --> 34:49.344
The palace is hosting a spring banquet. I was sent to invite you, my sister.

462
34:50.784 --> 34:51.985
Come, Rao.

463
34:53.705 --> 34:55.505
Lady Zheng wants to host

464
34:55.585 --> 34:56.784
a peace offering between you and the Crown Princess.

465
34:57.385 --> 34:58.625
A peace offering?

466
34:59.345 --> 35:02.145
On the Spring Purification Festival, you may bring her to the palace with you.

467
35:02.225 --> 35:04.625
Have a drink together and bury the hatchet.

468
35:04.705 --> 35:05.745
Then Mother can be at ease.

469
35:08.185 --> 35:09.545
And this peace offering…

470
35:10.305 --> 35:11.145
Am I invited?

471
35:11.945 --> 35:13.625
It's a spring banquet for the palace ladies.

472
35:13.705 --> 35:15.465
You're of course not invited.

473
35:15.545 --> 35:18.105
But Mother will be there, so you have nothing to worry about.

474
35:20.145 --> 35:22.305
Since Lady Zheng has been so gracious,

475
35:24.065 --> 35:25.145
I'd be happy to accept.

476
35:27.065 --> 35:28.385
Take these baskets to the kitchen.

477
35:28.985 --> 35:31.265
Mulberries spoil quickly. Share them with everyone.

478
35:31.785 --> 35:32.745
Yes.

479
35:37.105 --> 35:40.105
Every time I go to the palace, something bad happens.

480
35:42.345 --> 35:45.025
Lady Zheng's brother, Zheng Tan, is clever and capable.

481
35:45.825 --> 35:49.585
But the younger generation is mostly mediocre and spoiled.

482
35:50.105 --> 35:51.105
Not one fit for major roles.

483
35:57.145 --> 35:58.105
Now you've married me,

484
35:59.385 --> 36:00.905
the Zheng family is even more anxious.

485
36:03.145 --> 36:05.985
You're that intimidating, Lord Lu?

486
36:06.905 --> 36:08.505
Then I should've married you sooner.

487
36:11.265 --> 36:12.945
Whatever they're planning,

488
36:13.825 --> 36:16.905
we'll deal with it when the time comes.

489
36:28.305 --> 36:30.625
These oranges are sweet and tangy. Want to try one?

490
36:34.585 --> 36:35.625
Here, take it.

491
36:50.025 --> 36:51.225
Lady Hongxian.

492
36:55.345 --> 36:56.545
Here.

493
37:16.105 --> 37:18.625
SPRING PURIFICATION FESTIVAL

494
37:27.425 --> 37:28.625
Your Highness.

495
37:28.705 --> 37:31.865
I hear you have grown close to the Crown Princess lately.

496
37:32.545 --> 37:34.985
Forgive me for saying this, but the Crown Princess is no kind soul.

497
37:35.745 --> 37:38.225
You're beautiful, gentle and gracious.

498
37:38.825 --> 37:41.985
Don't let her manipulate you into making trouble for my sister.

499
37:43.225 --> 37:45.065
You've been spying on me, Your Highness.

500
37:45.145 --> 37:46.745
Now you have the nerve to question me?

501
37:47.785 --> 37:50.465
Your sister is ambitious and arrogant.

502
37:50.545 --> 37:51.825
Why should I put up with her?

503
37:54.025 --> 37:56.265
While you practiced music and painting beneath the wisteria,

504
37:56.785 --> 37:59.105
my sister's hands were raw from forced labor.

505
37:59.625 --> 38:00.945
The world has never been kind to her.

506
38:01.545 --> 38:04.025
Yet she gives everything she has to help those in need.

507
38:05.305 --> 38:08.265
How can you bring yourself to hurt someone like her, Hualou?

508
38:09.545 --> 38:11.265
Your sister stole the man I love.

509
38:12.665 --> 38:15.345
Is my brother-in-law the only brave, handsome man in the world?

510
38:16.505 --> 38:17.825
Beautiful as you are,

511
38:17.905 --> 38:20.345
surely you can find another husband.

512
38:22.185 --> 38:23.625
Don't you know?

513
38:24.145 --> 38:25.745
I'm about to marry Prince Fu.

514
38:26.265 --> 38:27.305
I don't have a choice.

515
38:28.145 --> 38:31.225
If you want a husband of noble birth,

516
38:32.745 --> 38:35.265
am I not a prince, too?

517
38:37.025 --> 38:38.305
Have you lost your mind?

518
38:38.385 --> 38:40.225
You're four years younger than me!

519
38:40.305 --> 38:41.705
How dare you toy with me like this?

520
38:42.625 --> 38:46.465
A beautiful lady like you has a heart worth more than gold.

521
38:47.505 --> 38:50.545
Even if you've done something wrong, someone else must have led you astray.

522
38:55.505 --> 38:56.425
Promise me.

523
38:57.065 --> 38:58.345
Don't go against your own heart

524
38:58.945 --> 39:00.905
just to make an enemy of my sister.

525
39:00.985 --> 39:02.105
Please?

526
39:07.145 --> 39:10.385
If you'll only give me a chance, Hualou, what's a four-year age gap?

527
39:10.465 --> 39:12.185
Age difference wouldn't matter.

528
39:12.265 --> 39:13.465
I wouldn't care.

529
39:28.425 --> 39:30.465
-That was so close! Try again. -So close!

530
39:31.225 --> 39:32.345
Go play with them.

531
39:50.505 --> 39:51.585
Lady Li.

532
39:52.745 --> 39:53.825
Lady Zheng.

533
39:53.905 --> 39:55.305
AUSPICIOUS DAYS, JOYOUS GATHERINGS

534
39:55.385 --> 39:56.305
Lady Wang.

535
39:56.825 --> 39:57.865
Rao.

536
40:03.225 --> 40:04.745
You needn't trouble yourself, Crown Princess.

537
40:04.825 --> 40:06.825
We're sisters. Rank doesn't matter between us.

538
40:07.585 --> 40:09.945
Things have been tense between us lately.

539
40:10.025 --> 40:11.425
As your older sister, I was at fault.

540
40:11.505 --> 40:13.785
I was thoughtless and hurt your feelings.

541
40:14.785 --> 40:16.465
I sincerely apologize.

542
40:16.545 --> 40:18.345
I hope you'll find it in your heart

543
40:18.425 --> 40:22.105
to put our differences behind us so we can be close again.

544
40:24.545 --> 40:27.305
Everyone knows your sister is generous.

545
40:27.385 --> 40:29.865
Besides, you both bear the Wei name.

546
40:29.945 --> 40:30.825
You're family, after all.

547
40:30.905 --> 40:36.345
Making such a grand apology only makes her seem petty.

548
40:42.065 --> 40:43.305
Thank you.

549
40:50.505 --> 40:53.105
Rao, you must be tired. Go sit down.

550
41:03.025 --> 41:05.345
Rao. You haven't met her yet.

551
41:06.305 --> 41:07.345
This is Yi Jiang.

552
41:07.425 --> 41:09.065
She serves Prince Fu.

553
41:09.665 --> 41:11.625
She's skilled at divination and reading faces.

554
41:11.705 --> 41:16.945
Just now, she even helped Lady Wang find her missing pearl bracelet.

555
41:17.025 --> 41:19.185
Yi Jiang, come here.

556
41:20.225 --> 41:21.945
Read my Rao's face, would you?

557
41:24.065 --> 41:24.945
Yes, Your Ladyship.

558
41:28.545 --> 41:29.625
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

559
41:30.265 --> 41:31.385
No need for formalities.

560
41:32.385 --> 41:33.225
YI JIANG, PRINCE FU'S FAVORITE CONCUBINE

561
41:33.305 --> 41:35.905
Your forehead is broad. Your eyes shine like morning stars.

562
41:36.705 --> 41:39.585
That shows wisdom, clarity, and keen insight.

563
41:39.665 --> 41:42.505
Your upper features are open, and your jaw commands respect.

564
41:42.585 --> 41:44.305
You were born for greatness.

565
41:45.425 --> 41:46.425
Thank you for your kind words.

566
41:47.665 --> 41:49.065
Your Highness once had a sister.

567
41:49.985 --> 41:51.665
Your fates are at odds.

568
41:52.345 --> 41:55.505
Like two stars that never share the sky,

569
41:55.585 --> 41:58.505
you must never meet again if you wish to live.

570
41:59.025 --> 42:00.665
Otherwise…

571
42:00.745 --> 42:01.905
Otherwise what?

572
42:03.065 --> 42:05.865
Your Highness already knows the answer.

573
42:07.025 --> 42:08.225
There's more.

574
42:08.305 --> 42:10.745
You face three deadly trials in your lifetime.

575
42:10.825 --> 42:12.385
Each time, more dangerous than the last.

576
42:12.985 --> 42:16.465
I pray you earn enough good fortune to survive them all.

577
42:28.665 --> 42:30.225
Deadly trials?

578
42:30.305 --> 42:32.025
What if she can't get through it?

579
42:32.105 --> 42:33.865
Bloodshed and death hang over her.

580
42:34.865 --> 42:36.985
If she cannot get through it,

581
42:37.065 --> 42:39.825
then I'm afraid her death is fast approaching.

582
42:39.905 --> 42:42.865
She will not live past her twenties.

583
44:57.425 --> 44:59.545
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
